---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: "/products/"
title: "Products"
description: "Products and platforms Max Murphy has built — marketplaces, fintech, enterprise platforms, AI tooling, and operating frameworks."
hasViz: true
hasFilter: true
---
{%- set categories = [] -%}
{%- for p in products -%}
  {%- if p.category not in categories -%}{%- set categories = (categories.push(p.category), categories) -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}

<section class="page-head wrap">
  <p class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--blue)">Products</p>
  <h1 class="display">Things I&rsquo;ve built.</h1>
  <p class="prose measure">Marketplaces reaching millions, fintech platforms taken from nothing to market, enterprise systems replacing the ones a business runs on, and internal AI tooling. Twelve years of product work, plus twenty years of building the web alongside it.</p>
</section>

<section class="section section--tight wrap" style="padding-top:0">

  <div class="viz" style="margin:0 0 1rem">
    <div class="kpi-row">
      {%- for s in profile.stats %}
      <div class="kpi">
        <div class="kpi__value">{{ s.value }}</div>
        <div class="kpi__label">{{ s.label }}</div>
        {% if s.note %}<div class="kpi__note">{{ s.note }}</div>{% endif %}
      </div>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>

  {#- Category filter. Progressive enhancement: without JS every card is
      visible and nothing is gated behind the buttons. -#}
  <div class="filter-bar" role="group" aria-label="Filter products by category">
    <button class="filter-chip" type="button" data-filter="all" aria-pressed="true">All</button>
    {%- for cat in categories %}
    <button class="filter-chip" type="button" data-filter="{{ cat }}" aria-pressed="false">{{ cat }}</button>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>

  <p class="filter-count" data-filter-count aria-live="polite">{{ products.length }} products</p>

  <div class="product-grid" data-filter-scope>
    {%- for p in products %}
    <article class="product-card" data-category="{{ p.category }}">
      <div>
        <div class="product-card__meta">
          <span>{{ p.category }}</span>
          <span>{{ p.org }}</span>
          <span>{{ p.years }}</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="product-card__name">{{ p.name }}</h2>
        <p class="product-card__summary">{{ p.summary }}</p>
        <p class="product-card__tech">{{ p.role }}{% if p.tech.length %} &middot; {{ p.tech | join(" · ") }}{% endif %}</p>
        {%- if p.caseStudy %}
        <p style="margin-top:.9rem"><a class="arrow-link" href="/case-studies/{{ p.caseStudy }}/">Read the case study</a></p>
        {%- endif %}
      </div>

      {%- if p.metrics.length %}
      <div class="product-card__metrics">
        {%- for m in p.metrics %}
        <div>
          <div class="product-metric__value">{{ m.value }}</div>
          <div class="product-metric__label">{{ m.label }}</div>
        </div>
        {%- endfor %}
      </div>
      {%- else %}
      <div></div>
      {%- endif %}
    </article>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>

  <p class="viz__note" style="margin-top:2rem;color:var(--ink-faint);font-size:.9rem">
    This list covers the products I can name publicly. Client work under NDA and the
    freelance sites aren&rsquo;t included.
  </p>
</section>

<section class="band cta">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="headline">Have an ambitious idea?</h2>
    <p class="prose measure" style="margin-inline:auto">I take on a small number of strategic engagements each year. Tell me about your problem &mdash; I&rsquo;ll tell you what I&rsquo;d do about it.</p>
    <p style="margin-top:2rem">
      <a class="btn btn--solid" href="/contact/" style="background:#fff;color:var(--blue)">Get in touch</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
